:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Archer (Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Archer''' (アーチャー) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Archer
|image = E 370.png
|appearance = [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,800¢ - 7,110¢
}}

==Enemy==
He has mild health and attack power but has high range, along with high piercing range so he can easily reach your main attackers. He acts very similarly to his [[Archer (Uber Rare Cat)|cat counterpart]], acting a backliner which snipes your units while other enemies take care of your frontline.

==Strategy==
A classic [[Long Distance]] enemy. Archer acts a piercing backliner, and in many of his appearances, he is supported by pushers that allow him to continuously chip at your attackers. Fortunately, his DPS is low, so treat him like a [[Loincloth Cat (Enemy)|Loincloth Cat]] with a blindspot. He does not have a very large inner range, so use melee units can easily push into his blindspot, which is easy as his attack rate is 6 seconds.

